msgid "Relay Shield"
msgstr "Relay Shield"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/relay-shield.rst:4
msgid ""
"The Relay Shield switches two high-power AC or DC loads up to 60 W per relay"
" from the OpenMV Cam, with a 6-36 V input plus an ADC input and a digital "
"I/O line for sync."
msgstr ""
"Relay Shield preklapa dva visokoenergetska AC ili DC trošila do 60 W po "
"releju s OpenMV kamere, uz 6-36 V ulaz plus ADC ulaz i digitalnu I/O liniju "
"za sinkronizaciju."

